OL,3,GNEWSATown festival to celebrate Alfred
OL,4,Athe Great
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of an annual festival
OL,7,Fdedicated to Alfred the Great have said
OL,8,Fthey want to deepen people's
OL,9,Funderstanding of the medieval King.
OL,11,FAlfredfest is celebrated annually in
OL,12,FWantage, the birthplace of of the Saxon
OL,13,FKing of Wessex, on the anniversary of
OL,14,Fhis death.
OL,16,FSunday's events include a procession to
OL,17,Fhis Victorian statue, a blessing of the
OL,18,Ftown, lectures and a recital of a new
OL,19,Fopera about Alfred's daughter,
OL,20,FAethelflaed.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
