OL,3,GNEWSATown festival to celebrate Alfred
OL,4,Athe Great
OL,5,
OL,6,FLay preacher and organiser David
OL,7,FRichardson said he wanted people to see
OL,8,Fbeyond the well known story of him
OL,9,F"burning the cakes" and realise Alfred
OL,10,Fwas "where England as a kingdom
OL,11,Fstarted".
